  "description": "Saving the world is a typical mission for Agent 08, but he's never had to do it like this: by going back to high school. As Joe, new transfer at Maryweather High, he's immediately drawn to the feisty Naomi Heart, whose father's last invention can't fall into the wrong hands. But navigating the world of outcasts, bullies and headmasters might leave Joe in over his head. Can he survive with his identity-and a girl's heart-in one piece?\nSource: Tapas",
